---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Data Analytics Services
description: "Five data analytics services — data management, advanced analytics, business intelligence, data visualization, and data consulting — scoped to your organization's actual needs."
showServiceList: true
breadcrumbs:
  - name: Home
    url: /
  - name: Services
    url: /services/
---
{% import "icons/icons.njk" as icons %}
{% from "partials/answer-box.njk" import answerBox %}
{% from "partials/cta-band.njk" import ctaBand %}

<section class="hero container">
  <span class="hero__eyebrow">Services</span>
  <h1>Data analytics services built around your actual data, not a fixed package</h1>
  {{ answerBox("DataQube Analytics offers five services — data management, advanced analytics, business intelligence, data visualization, and data consulting — that cover the full path from scattered raw data to confident, day-to-day decisions. Each is scoped individually based on your current data maturity and goals.") }}
</section>

<section class="section container">
  <h2>Compare our services</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="comparison-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">Service</th>
          <th scope="col">Primary focus</th>
          <th scope="col">Typical output</th>
          <th scope="col">Best fit when&hellip;</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row"><a href="/services/data-management/">Data Management</a></th>
          <td>Collecting, cleaning, and governing data</td>
          <td>Integrated warehouse, governance framework</td>
          <td>Data is scattered, inconsistent, or hard to trust</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row"><a href="/services/advanced-analytics/">Advanced Analytics</a></th>
          <td>Statistical modeling and prediction</td>
          <td>Forecasts, predictive models</td>
          <td>You need to know what's likely to happen next</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row"><a href="/services/business-intelligence/">Business Intelligence</a></th>
          <td>Reporting on what already happened</td>
          <td>Dashboards, KPI reports</td>
          <td>Teams need day-to-day visibility into performance</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row"><a href="/services/data-visualization/">Data Visualization</a></th>
          <td>Presenting data clearly for a specific audience</td>
          <td>Interactive charts, custom graphics</td>
          <td>Existing reports are accurate but hard to understand</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row"><a href="/services/data-consulting/">Data Consulting</a></th>
          <td>Strategic data direction and governance</td>
          <td>Data strategy, roadmap, governance framework</td>
          <td>You need a plan before committing to a platform</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>All services</h2>
    <div class="grid grid--3 mt-8">
      {% for s in services %}
      <a class="card card--link" href="/services/{{ s.slug }}/">
        {{ icons[s.icon]("card__icon") }}
        <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.shortDescription }}</p>
        <span class="card__more">Learn more &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section container">
  {{ ctaBand("Not sure which service fits?", "Tell us about your current data setup and what you're trying to achieve — we'll recommend where to start.", "Contact Us", "/contact/") }}
</section>
